{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WE WELCOME YOU TO OCEAN CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After years away from your hometown, you're running low on cash. It\u2019s time to pay a visit to an old friend in Ocean City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-73dfaf57bcac2b.gif?t=1750888220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>GET NOTICED BY THE BIG SHOTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you arrive in Ocean City, your inbox will be flooded with job offers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kill, steal, hack</strong> or go for something more low-key, like delivering burgers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every job counts, as long as it pays.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-3cbfa1fba4cba4.gif?t=1750888220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>START YOUR BUSINESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy rundown shacks and turn them into your operational hubs</strong>. Start a mining farm, resell human organs, or invest in hotels and nightclubs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-3e9eb3212f5a83.gif?t=1750888220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE DARKNET IS YOUR KINGDOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access the in-game browser and <strong>dive into the darknet</strong>. Browse illegal sites, purchase goods, or meet with clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-30af5db6fc15b1.gif?t=1750888220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE A WORLD RICH IN DETAIL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>vast city of Ocean City</strong> lets you play in a <strong>rich open world</strong>, where you can cause chaos in the streets, drive and customize a wide range of vehicles, buy properties around the city, party at nightclubs, or grab a burger at a fast food joint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-869fde6cf04347.gif?t=1750888220\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761450?t=1750888220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761450?t=1750888220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/5c40da6d88362656784286e401cd9696624c07ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750888220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/5c40da6d88362656784286e401cd9696624c07ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750888220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WE WELCOME YOU TO OCEAN CITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After years away from your hometown, you're running low on cash. It\u2019s time to pay a visit to an old friend in Ocean City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-73dfaf57bcac2b.gif?t=1750888220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>GET NOTICED BY THE BIG SHOTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once you arrive in Ocean City, your inbox will be flooded with job offers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kill, steal, hack</strong> or go for something more low-key, like delivering burgers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every job counts, as long as it pays.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-3cbfa1fba4cba4.gif?t=1750888220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>START YOUR BUSINESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buy rundown shacks and turn them into your operational hubs</strong>. Start a mining farm, resell human organs, or invest in hotels and nightclubs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-3e9eb3212f5a83.gif?t=1750888220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE DARKNET IS YOUR KINGDOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Access the in-game browser and <strong>dive into the darknet</strong>. Browse illegal sites, purchase goods, or meet with clients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-30af5db6fc15b1.gif?t=1750888220\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EXPLORE A WORLD RICH IN DETAIL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>vast city of Ocean City</strong> lets you play in a <strong>rich open world</strong>, where you can cause chaos in the streets, drive and customize a wide range of vehicles, buy properties around the city, party at nightclubs, or grab a burger at a fast food joint.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761450/extras/ezgif-869fde6cf04347.gif?t=175088822